@*
    Enqueue Job page (Req 12.1, 12.2) — a thin host that renders the JobBuilder composite in
    Enqueue mode. In this mode the JobBuilder hides the Schedule_Builder entirely and requires no
    cron (Req 12.1), presents the Method_Picker and Parameter_Builder, and exposes a queue selector
    defaulting to "default" (Req 12.2).

    Enqueue is NOT gated behind EnableRecurringJobAdmin (that gate only applies to recurring job
    administration). Read-only gating is handled by the JobBuilder itself, which renders its own
    persistent read-only banner and disables the mutating controls (Req 4.1, 4.2).
*@
@page "/jobs/enqueue"

<PageTitle>Enqueue Job</PageTitle>

<div style="max-width: 720px;">
    <h2 class="mb-3">Enqueue Job</h2>

    <JobBuilder Mode="JobBuilderMode.Enqueue" />
</div>
